
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5104

### Create a ride - Valid request

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rides
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Eastern Himalayan Trail",
  "description": "A BBG motorcycle adventure.",
  "type": "MultiDayRide",
  "startLocationName": "Kolkata",
  "startLocationAddress": "Kolkata, West Bengal",
  "destinationName": "Charkhole",
  "destinationAddress": "Charkhole, West Bengal",
  "startDate": "2027-01-15T06:00:00+05:30",
  "endDate": "2027-01-18T18:00:00+05:30",
  "maximumCapacity": 20,
  "capacityPolicy": "Waitlist"
}

###

### Create a ride - Invalid schedule

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rides
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Invalid Ride",
  "description": "Testing invalid schedule.",
  "type": "DayRide",
  "startLocationName": "Kolkata",
  "startLocationAddress": "Kolkata, West Bengal",
  "destinationName": "Digha",
  "destinationAddress": "Digha, West Bengal",
  "startDate": "2027-01-15T10:00:00+05:30",
  "endDate": "2027-01-14T10:00:00+05:30",
  "maximumCapacity": 10,
  "capacityPolicy": "CloseAtCapacity"
}


### Get an existing ride

GET http://localhost:5104/api/rides/95113c8b-ab68-4d26-9165-6cdaad0a83a9
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a non-existing ride

GET http://localhost:5104/api/rides/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### Get all rides
GET http://localhost:5104/api/rides?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10

###

### Get published rides
GET http://localhost:5104/api/rides?status=Published

###

### Get multi-day rides
GET http://localhost:5104/api/rides?type=MultiDayRide

###

### Get upcoming rides
GET http://localhost:5104/api/rides?upcomingOnly=true

###

### Get invalid page size
GET http://localhost:5104/api/rides?pageNumber=1&pageSize=500